{"composerId":"66ebdfd0-e7cd-4308-956e-7625c93a0dde","name":"Explore new Broadsheet theme","_v":17,"conversation":[{"bubbleId":"0df4728f-36d5-4299-857d-ff69e115ceb6","type":1,"text":"Explore the new website design at /Users/dhruveshpatel/Files/IESL/NAR/code/broadsheet-jekyll-theme thoroughly.\n\nI need a complete inventory of:\n1. Directory structure and how content vs theme is organized\n2. All content pages (especially top-level .md files like software.md, mentorship.md)\n3. Navigation / site config (_config.yml, menus)\n4. Collections, data files, includes, layouts\n5. What has already been customized for Dhruvesh vs what's still theme boilerplate\n6. Blog posts if any\n7. Assets\n8. README or docs about how the theme expects content to be organized\n\nReturn:\n- A clear tree of the content organization\n- List of every user-facing page/route with file path\n- Key _config.yml settings\n- Whether pages living at repo root (software.md) is the theme's intended pattern or a migration choice\n- What content appears already migrated vs leftover theme demo content\n- How the theme is meant to be used (as a gem theme vs forked site)\n\nBe thorough. Read _config.yml, README, navigation, and skim all top-level md pages and key layouts.","unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"c22f1028-92fc-4765-8e7c-b1e347b8a02d","type":2,"text":"","unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"9bf52372-be14-4837-9edf-6a19194e34b7","type":2,"text":"","capabilityType":30,"unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"b143b25a-1227-43f1-89f4-511743eb891d","type":2,"text":"","unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"d203548b-bd13-4f39-a645-b51768bec382","type":2,"text":"","capabilityType":15,"unifiedMode":2,"toolFormerData":{"tool":0,"name":"update_current_step","rawArgs":"{}","status":"loading"}},{"bubbleId":"9e9b08e9-5d17-4297-9cae-df36dc17defe","type":2,"text":"","capabilityType":15,"unifiedMode":2,"toolFormerData":{"tool":42,"name":"glob_file_search","rawArgs":"{}","status":"loading"}},{"bubbleId":"5d549dd2-8a7d-4453-9851-507c173a7135","type"